35,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The ledger shows a quarter cut. The booking system misses unbooked work.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,Readmissions dropped during the trial. The joint clinic failed due to rota issues.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,Therapy staff are leaving. Midwifery has slack. Ward agency costs are rising.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Rooms are full by noon. Off-site visits earn no tariff.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,Data agreements take fourteen months. Shared nursing visits often fail.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Kenji, if off-site visits earn nothing, home care is financially risky.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Midori, the midwifery slack is interesting. Why is it there?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, birth numbers are falling. It’s a demographic shift.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Jonathan, so we must stick to on-site activities to bill properly.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, the joint clinic failure warns against shared responsibility without clear ownership.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, the data agreement delay makes external coordination very slow.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, if rooms are full, a day unit might not fit.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Jonathan, the agency costs mean we can't afford to overburden existing staff.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, the midwifery slack could absorb a new perinatal service easily.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, the readmission drop suggests home follow-up has real value, despite the tariff issue.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
